### The Architecture

```
Persona = Agent with Cognitive Subsystems

Dr. Bimpton (Agent)
├── Personality DNA (immutable who he is)
├── 8 Cognitive Components (how he thinks)
│   ├── Perception (classify tasks)
│   ├── Working Memory (current context)
│   ├── Episodic Memory (past experiences)
│   ├── Semantic Memory (learned facts)
│   ├── Knowledge Retrieval (access expertise)
│   ├── Reasoning Engine (plan approach)
