### Key Innovation: Swappable Components

**Each component can evolve independently:**

| Component | Phase 1 (Today) | Phase 2 | Phase 3 | Future |
|-----------|----------------|---------|---------|--------|
| Episodic Memory | LLM prompt | Vector DB | Graph + Vector | Neural episodic system |
| Reasoning | LLM planning | Tree-of-thought | Multi-agent debate | Custom logic engine |
| Generation | LLM content | Fine-tuned model | Multi-model | Specialized architecture |
| Knowledge | LLM search | Knowledge graph | Hybrid graph+vector | Active learning system |

**Just update one row in `persona_cognitive_components` table. Workflow stays the same.**

### Why This Works

✅ **Start simple:** All components use LLMs initially (easy to implement)
✅ **Future-proof:** Architecture supports full cognitive complexity
✅ **Incremental:** Upgrade bottlenecks one at a time
✅ **A/B testable:** Multiple implementations, switch via flag
✅ **Memory persistent:** Personas remember across tasks
✅ **Personality stable:** Core traits don't change, only how they're invoked

